{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>one of the people</b> Two instances: here, and the other: \"for one of the people came\" (1 Samuel 26:15). And there it concerns King David, when he took the spear from beside Saul's head — what is there concerns a king, so too here he said it on his own account, for he is the king."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:02.570569701Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}